# Title: Restricted Software Access By SRP
# ID: b4c8da4a-1c12-46b0-8a2b-0a8521d03442
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2023-01-12
# Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.execution, attack.t1072
# Description: Detects restricted access to applications by the Software Restriction Policies (SRP) policy
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Provider_Name equals "Microsoft-Windows-SoftwareRestrictionPolicies" AND (EventID equals "865" OR EventID equals "866" OR EventID equals "867" OR EventID equals "868" OR EventID equals "882"))
